    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="be977401-1f7c-50c3-839d-dff97190bd00" activityNameId="46e69e41-4a89-53a4-b46d-38aca8b9b1e1" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Headset (bluetooth), for smartphone, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Headset (bluetooth), for smartphone, at plant
The data set represents the production of smartphone bluetooh headset; UUID: 822d22c5-0fae-3e09-b79c-c871e174e83e
The dataset comprises of high density polyethylene, battery, circuit boards, USB cables, and passive electronic components, all summing up to approximately 200 grams of bluetooth headset weight. The weight of the circuit boards is obtained specifically from a customizable PWB manufacturer. The product is a representation of standard Bluetooth headphones devices in the market. Additionally, the manufacturing electricity energy is assumed to be similar with the other headsets according to literature, ~ 2 kWh per device. The packaging materials are modeled as corrugated board and printed papers with a total weight of 400 grams.
Location: Data for global average bluetooth headset for smartphone
Technology: The headset for smartphone is equipped with bluetooth connectivity.
Time period: Unspecified
Production volume: unknown
Sampling: Literature &amp; own estimations
Extrapolations: Average technology
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_822d22c5-0fae-3e09-b79c-c871e174e83e.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
